{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c44b6757-fa55-81ac-9335-2a938c13f627",
  "created_at": "2026-01-25T16:16:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Donna Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:09:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:10:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Donna Conti. I'm calling on the storm line because I know City Hall's closed on a Sunday, so I figured this is the one that gets answered."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:10:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You figured right. What's going on, Donna?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:10:18-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street in front of my house is a pond. A pond. I'm at 76 Dixon Street, in the North End, and the water is across the whole road. Cars are coming through and throwing wakes like speedboats, right up toward the front steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:10:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not good. Is the water getting near the house itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:10:43-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not in the house, no. But it's up over the curb, and it's only going to get worse. It's been rain on top of that snow all afternoon. Sorry, there's wind on my end, I'm out of the house right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:11:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. Which drain is it, the one right in front of your place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:11:10-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The grate right out front, yes. Before I left I went out and cleared the leaves off it by hand. Soaked to the elbows. And it helped, I'll give it that, the water went down. For about ten minutes. Then it came right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:11:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it drained for a bit and then backed up again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:11:35-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. So it's not just leaves. Something is wrong down below. Which is what I want to know: when did somebody last come by and look at that drain? Because I have not seen a truck on Dixon Street in a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:11:54-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the cleaning history in front of me on this line. I can put in the report with your address and ask that the record of the last service be pulled. Would that work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:12:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It would, but I'd like an actual answer. A date. Not just a note in a file somewhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:12:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll flag it that you're asking for the last service date specifically. Can I get a number to reach you at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:12:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0172."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:12:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0172. And that's Conti, C-O-N-T-I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:12:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. And it's Donna, with two n's. People always put one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:12:38-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two n's, got it. Now, I'll be honest, with the storm going right now the crews are stretched thin and are mostly on the worst spots, so I can't tell you when somebody gets there tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:12:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I figured. I'm not asking for a miracle at this minute. I'm asking that this isn't the same story as every other storm. It gets reported, nothing happens, it floods again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:13:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. I'll mark it as a repeat trouble spot as best I can from what you're telling me. Is the water deep enough that cars are stalling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:13:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not stalling yet. Just those wakes. One fellow in a pickup went through so fast it hit the sidewalk. If an old lady were standing there she'd be soaked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:13:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then I'll note it as a traffic hazard too, so it gets looked at sooner. Is there anything blocking the road, a branch or ice or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:13:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, just the water. Hang on, they're calling the boarding. [pause] Okay, no, the line's barely moving. I'm waiting for the ferry and it's slow as molasses today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:13:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, so you're not even home to watch it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, my neighbor sent me a picture, that's how I know it's gotten worse. I was out there with my hands in the grate at one o'clock, and by now it's this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:14:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. If you're able to, stay out of the water when you get back. Storm runoff can be nasty, and you can't see what's under it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:14:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know, I know. I'm not an idiot, I'm just fed up. You can put that in the note too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:14:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll say the resident is very concerned that this keeps happening. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:14:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, not concerned. Fed up is more accurate. But sure, put whatever words go in the box."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:14:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that it keeps recurring and nothing has been done. How's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:15:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's closer. And it's true."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:15:03-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I've got 76 Dixon Street, the drain out front, standing water across the road, cleared by hand and backed up again within ten minutes, and a request for the last cleaning date. Did I miss anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:15:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One thing. It's not standing water, it's moving water. It's coming down from up the hill and collecting at my corner, so it's a lot more than a puddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:15:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know, I'll change that. Water collecting at the low point and not able to get away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:15:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Thank you, Denise. You were straight with me, I appreciate that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:15:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. If it gets worse, like if it reaches the house, call this line right back. Someone's here all through the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:15:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. And I'd like a call back about that date, please. Tomorrow's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:16:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in the note. Stay safe on the ferry, Donna."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:16:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Okay, they're moving finally. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T16:16:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye bye."
    }
  ],
